"<p>Need to upgrade to a larger server or switch hosting providers?</p>\n<p>Under <strong>App -> Settings -> Move to another server</strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>The app is stopped and backed up on the source server.</li>\n<li>The encrypted archive is transferred to the target server via your configured S3/R2 storage destination.</li>\n<li>The app is restored and verified on the target server.</li>\n<li>Traefik routes and DNS records are updated automatically.</li>\n</ol>"